: "Lies of P: Deluxe Edition", "platforms": [169, 48, 6, 167, 49], "player_perspectives": [{"id": 2, "name": "Third person"}], "release_dates": [{"id": 516656, "date": 1694736000, "platform": 6, "y": 2023, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 516659, "date": 1694736000, "platform": 169, "y": 2023, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 516658, "date": 1694822400, "platform": 167, "y": 2023, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 517030, "date": 1694736000, "platform": 49, "y": 2023, "release_region": {"id": 2, "region": "north_america"}}, {"id": 517031, "date": 1694736000, "platform": 169, "y": 2023, "release_region": {"id": 2, "region": "north_america"}}, {"id": 516657, "date": 1694736000, "platform": 49, "y": 2023, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 516650, "date": 1694822400, "platform": 48, "y": 2023, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 1147414, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scolcm.jpg"}, {"id": 1147412, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scolck.jpg"}, {"id": 1147413, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scolcl.jpg"}, {"id": 1147409, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scolch.jpg"}, {"id": 1147411, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scolcj.jpg"}, {"id": 1147416, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scolco.jpg"}, {"id": 1147408, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scolcg.jpg"}, {"id": 1147410, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scolci.jpg"}, {"id": 1147415, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scolcn.jpg"}], "slug": "lies-of-p-deluxe-edition", "storyline": "The tale unfolds in the once-glorious city of Krat, a metropolis built upon the discovery of a mysterious mineral called Ergo, which the Order of Alchemists used to power lifelike Puppets designed by the craftsman Geppetto. Bound by a sacred Covenant never to harm humans or lie, these Puppets became woven into every aspect of daily life, and Krat flourished. Then came ruin. A dreadful Petrification Disease spread through the population, and a sudden phenomenon called the Puppet Frenzy drove the once-obedient machines to turn murderously against their masters, plunging the city into massacre and chaos. It is amid this collapse that a puppet named P awakens alone in an abandoned train at Krat Central Station. Unlike the others, P looks fully human and possesses free will, and a mysterious woman's voice soon calls out to guide him.", "summary": "Lies of P is an action role-playing game set in a dark, Belle \u00c9poque-inspired city overrun by deadly puppets. Players control Pinocchio, reimagined as a mechanical warrior, navigating a decaying world while making choices that affect the unfolding narrative. The game features challenging melee combat, weapon customization, and a mechanical arm with various abilities.\n\nThe Deluxe Edition includes:\n\u2022 The base game;\n\u2022 The Great Venigni\u2019s Signature Coat;\n\u2022 The Great Venigni\u2019s Glasses;\n\u2022 Mask worn by those preparing for the festival.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/lies-of-p-deluxe-edition"}